      "description": "Dynamic S-curved neck, head cranium, crest feather plumes, orbital skin mask, golden iris, pupil with specular catchlights, brow ridge."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "layer_11_pelican_bill_and_gular_pouch",
      "description": "Upper culmen bill with amber dertrum tip hook, translucent salmon-rose gular pouch with elastic expansion striations, Barnaby the sardine easter egg."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
