  "implementation_checklist_for_render_agent": [
    "Verify viewBox is exactly '0 0 1200 900' with preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid meet'.",
    "Bicycle wheel centers must sit precisely at (350, 610) for rear and (850, 610) for front, with outer tire radius 130 touching ground at Y=740.",
    "Generate exactly 24 spokes per wheel using parametric angle loops: x = cx + r * cos(theta), y = cy + r * sin(theta).",
    "Occlusion hierarchy must strictly follow layers_order (1 through 18) to avoid visual sorting glitches between limbs, frame, and wheels.",
    "The pelican pouch must exhibit translucency (opacity ~0.88) so the charming little passenger sardine is visible inside/peeking out.",
    "Dynamic windblown details (scarf streamers, crest plumes, tail ruffles) must curve horizontally leftwards to heighten forward cycling momentum."
  ]
}